.46, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "chorus1"}, {"text": "Short friends, tall friends, we love them all!", "start": 3.92, "end": 7.94, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "chorus1"}, {"text": "Opposites, opposites, sing along,", "start": 7.94, "end": 11.8, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "chorus1"}, {"text": "Big and small in the zoo song!", "start": 12.92, "end": 15.42, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "chorus1"}, {"text": "The elephant is big, so big,", "start": 19.72, "end": 22.1, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "verse1"}, {"text": "Milo is small, a little twig!", "start": 22.88, "end": 26.9, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "verse1"}, {"text": "The giraffe is tall, way up there,", "start": 27.06, "end": 30.18, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "verse1"}, {"text": "The hippo's legs are short, I swear!", "start": 31.02, "end": 35.04, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "verse1"}, {"text": "Stretch up big, then crouch down small,", "start": 35.06, "end": 38.96, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "prechorus1"}, {"text": "Ready, friends? Let's sing it all!", "start": 39.32, "end": 43.3, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "prechorus1"}, {"text": "Big and small, big and small,", "start": 43.32, "end": 46.75, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "chorus2"}, {"text": "Short friends, tall friends, we love them all!", "start": 47.2, "end": 51.14, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "chorus2"}, {"text": "Opposites, opposites, sing along,", "start": 51.16, "end": 56.1, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "chorus2"}, {"text": "Big and small in the zoo song!", "start": 56.2, "end": 58.72, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "chorus2"}, {"text": "The zebra runs fast, zoom, zoom, zoom,", "start": 62.94, "end": 66.24, "who": "host", "kind": "sing", "section": "verse2"}, {"text": "The sleepy lion is slow, yawn, boom!", "start": 66.24, "end": 70.48, "who": "host", "kind": "sing